{
  "key": 22894,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneGym_Text_MayleneIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello.\n",
        "I’m pleased to meet you.\r",
        "I’m Maylene, and I’m the Gym\n",
        "Leader.\r",
        "I don’t really know what it means to\n",
        "be strong, or how I got to be the\f",
        "Gym Leader.\r",
        "But I will do the best I can as the\n",
        "Gym Leader.\r",
        "I take battling very seriously.\n",
        "Whenever you’re ready!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut.\n",
        "C’est un plaisir de te rencontrer.\r",
        "Je suis Mélina, le Champion de cette\n",
        "Arène.\r",
        "Je ne sais pas ce que c’est qu’être\n",
        "forte, ni comment je suis devenue\f",
        "Champion d’Arène.\r",
        "Mais je ferai de mon mieux pour faire\n",
        "honneur à mon rang.\r",
        "Je prends le combat très au sérieux.\n",
        "C’est quand tu veux!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneGym_Text_BeatMaylene",
      "en_US": [
        "...OK.\n",
        "You win.\r",
        "That was a tough loss.\n",
        "I learned a lot from it.\r",
        "Please, accept this Gym Badge.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "... Très bien.\n",
        "Tu as gagné.\r",
        "Quel combat!\n",
        "J’ai beaucoup appris.\r",
        "Accepte ce Badge d’Arène, s’il te plaît.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneGym_Text_MayleneReceiveBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Cobble Badge from Maylene."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtient le\n",
        "Badge Pavé de Mélina."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneGym_Text_MayleneExplainBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Um... I should explain about that\n",
        "official Pokémon League Gym Badge.\r",
        "With it, you can use the hidden move Fly\n",
        "outside of battle.\r",
        "Oh, and since you now have four Gym\n",
        "Badges, Pokémon obtained in trades\f",
        "will obey you up to Lv. 50.\r",
        "Oh, and please take this as well.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hum...\n",
        "Je ferais bien de te parler de ce Badge.\r",
        "Grâce à ce Badge officiel de la Ligue\n",
        "Pokémon, tu pourras utiliser la\f",
        "capacité secrète Vol hors combat.\r",
        "De plus, maintenant que tu as quatre\n",
        "Badges, les Pokémon obtenus au cours\f",
        "d’un échange t’obéiront jusqu’au\f",
        "niveau 50.\r",
        "Oh, j’ai une autre récompense.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneGym_Text_MayleneExplainTM60",
      "en_US": [
        "That {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} contains the move\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Um... That move inflicts damage,\n",
        "and it robs the target’s HP."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} contient\n",
        "la capacité {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Hum... Cette capacité inflige des dégâts\n",
        "et dérobe les PV de la cible."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneGym_Text_MayleneAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Gee, I’m hungry...\r",
        "Oh, sorry, it’s nothing.\n",
        "I didn’t say anything.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I can’t explain what\n",
        "it means to be strong.\r",
        "I don’t know how much effort goes\n",
        "into being strong...\r",
        "But being with Pokémon lets us\n",
        "keep making the effort, doesn’t it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mince, j’ai une faim de loup...\r",
        "Oh, excuse-moi, ce n’est rien.\n",
        "Non, je n’ai rien dit.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, je ne sais pas ce que\n",
        "c’est que la force.\r",
        "Je n’ai aucune idée des efforts à\n",
        "fournir pour devenir forte...\r",
        "Mais rester avec les Pokémon nous\n",
        "pousse à progresser, pas vrai?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneGym_Text_GymGuideBeforeBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, there!\n",
        "How’s it going, Champ-to-be?\r",
        "The Gym Leader is a user of\n",
        "Fighting-type Pokémon.\r",
        "She’d be a terror against Normal-type\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "But! And it’s a big but!\n",
        "Just between you and me...\r",
        "Maylene, the Gym Leader, said Flying-\n",
        "and Psychic-type Pokémon could be\f",
        "real trouble for her!\r",
        "If you want to battle her, smack the\n",
        "punching bags along the rails.\r",
        "You have to hit those bags hard!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hé, salut!\n",
        "Comment va notre futur Maître?\r",
        "Le Champion de cette Arène utilise des\n",
        "Pokémon de type Combat.\r",
        "Elle est la terreur des Pokémon\n",
        "de type Normal.\r",
        "Mais! Et c’est un grand mais!\n",
        "Entre nous...\r",
        "Mélina, le Champion d’Arène, a dit\n",
        "que les Pokémon de type Vol et Psy\f",
        "lui posaient de gros problèmes!\r",
        "Pour l’atteindre, fais glisser les sacs\n",
        "de frappe le long des rails.\r",
        "Vas-y franco!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneGym_Text_GymGuideAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You’ve beaten the Gym Leader!\r",
        "Of course, I thought you’d win."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Tu as vaincu le Champion d’Arène!\r",
        "Bien sûr, j’ai toujours su que\n",
        "tu allais gagner."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneGym_Text_GymStatueBeforeBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Veilstone City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Maylene\r",
        "Certified Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
